      "The Duelist mirror's golden inputs come from a seeded random policy that also reacts to the state (guarding, grab escapes, follow-ups), using only fields that existed before the kits. The task says 'random-input'. I chose this over pure random input, which gave only 2 blocks in 6,000 frames.",
